      "parameters": {
        "content": "### SecOps MCP Enrichment Server\nExposes SecOps enrichment as MCP tools at the MCP Server Trigger endpoint (path `secops`). Any MCP client (Claude Code, an analyst's agent, another n8n workflow via MCP Client Tool) can call: **search_runbooks** (IR playbooks from Pinecone `secops-kb`) and **scan_url** (urlscan.io).\n\n**Auth:** None for the demo — switch to Bearer + add a credential before exposing externally. **Wire-up:** OpenAI + Pinecone on search; urlscan.io on scan.",
        "height": 350,
        "width": 900,
        "color": 4
      },
